        <text>&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Dear Applicant,&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Thank you for your submitting your application and supporting documentation.&lt;br /&gt;
You are now been invited for a quick interview on Zoom to have assessed a few areas, such as:&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Capability to take the course&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Past learning and academic record&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Relevant work experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Interest in and motivation to take the course&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;The interview will take between 10 and 15 minutes, during which you will also have the opportunity&amp;nbsp;to ask any questions about Dorset College and the course that you are interested in.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://professionalcoursesinterview.youcanbook.me/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;https://professionalcoursesinterview.youcanbook.me/&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;book your slot.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Regards,&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Luize Strohschoen&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Professional Courses and Springboard Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
